###
# Allow-list tests
# C# validator accepts only these exact values (case-sensitive):
#   category: Account Access | Application Error | Performance | User Interface | Billing | Other
#   priority: Low | Medium | High | Critical
# Expected: 200 with category/priority from those lists.
# If Gemini returns anything else (Authentication, Security, reporting, high, etc.)
# the API should fail with 500: unsupported category/priority.

### Allow-list Category 01 - Account Access
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Locked out after password reset",
  "description": "A synthetic user completed a password reset but still cannot sign in. The account shows as active and no MFA prompt appears."
}

### Allow-list Category 02 - Application Error
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Save ticket throws an unhandled exception",
  "description": "A synthetic agent clicks Save on an existing ticket and the app shows an unhandled exception. The ticket is not updated and the error repeats every time."
}

### Allow-list Category 03 - Performance
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Global search takes more than 90 seconds",
  "description": "A synthetic operations user says customer search hangs for over 90 seconds during business hours and sometimes times out before results appear."
}

### Allow-list Category 04 - User Interface
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Create-ticket buttons overlap on a small laptop",
  "description": "A synthetic agent on a 1366x768 screen cannot click Save because Cancel and Save overlap. No error occurs; the layout is unusable."
}

### Allow-list Category 05 - Billing
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Subscription billed after cancellation",
  "description": "A synthetic finance user cancelled the plan on 1 September but was charged again on 5 September. They want the extra invoice reversed."
}

### Allow-list Category 06 - Other
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "How do I change the company logo?",
  "description": "A synthetic supervisor asks where to upload a new company logo. This is a how-to question, not a product failure or billing issue."
}

### Allow-list Priority 01 - Low
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Typo in the help page footer",
  "description": "A synthetic user noticed a spelling mistake in the footer of the help page. The rest of the product works and no workflow is blocked."
}

