  "description": "A synthetic agent applies a status filter, goes to page 2, and the filter clears. They can still work but have to reapply the filter each time."
}

### Allow-list Priority 03 - High
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Finance team cannot open the payments page",
  "description": "A synthetic finance lead says all eight finance users get an error opening Payments since 08:30. Invoices cannot be processed until this is fixed."
}

### Allow-list Priority 04 - Critical
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Checkout is down for every customer",
  "description": "A synthetic on-call engineer reports that all customers fail checkout with HTTP 500. No orders have completed for 20 minutes and revenue has stopped."
}

### Allow-list Off-list 01 - Must not return Authentication
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Authentication failed after password change",
  "description": "A synthetic user changed their password and now authentication fails on every login attempt. Expect category Account Access, not Authentication."
}

### Allow-list Off-list 02 - Must not return Reporting
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Monthly reporting export crashes",
  "description": "A synthetic support user gets an application crash when exporting the monthly reporting pack. Expect Application Error or Other, not Reporting."
}

### Allow-list Off-list 03 - Must not return Security
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Security alert for a login from another country",
  "description": "A synthetic user received a security alert for a successful login from an unknown city and wants the session revoked. Expect Account Access or Other, not Security."
