### Allow-list Off-list 04 - Must not return Integration
POST {{AiTicketTriage.Api_HttpsHostAddress}}/api/ai/tickets/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Slack integration webhook stopped posting alerts",
  "description": "A synthetic on-call engineer says the Slack integration no longer posts incident alerts after the webhook URL was rotated. Expect Application Error or Other, not Integration."
